{"name":"Piece of Cake","hex":"#ede7c8","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"piece of cake","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A job, task or other activity that is pleasant or, by extension, easy or simple.","Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see piece,‎ cake."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/piece_of_cake"}],"entries":[{"title":"Piece of Cake (novel)","blocks":[{"text":"Piece of Cake is a 1983 novel by Derek Robinson which follows a fictional Royal Air Force fighter squadron through the first year of World War II, and the Battle of Britain. It was later made into the 1988 television serial Piece of Cake."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/39/Piece_of_Cake_%28novel%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piece_of_Cake_(novel)"},{"title":"Piece of Cake (manga)","blocks":[{"text":"Piece of Cake  is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by George Asakura. It was serialized in Shodensha's josei manga magazine Feel Young from July 2003 to December 2008, with its chapters collected in five wideban volumes. A spin-off manga, titled Piece of Cake: Bangai-hen, was serialized in the same magazine from March to June 2015. A live action film adaptation directed by Tomorowo Taguchi premiered in September 2015."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/82/Piece_of_Cake_%28manga%29_1.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piece_of_Cake_(manga)"},{"title":"Cake","blocks":[{"text":"Cake is a baker's confectionery made by combining flour with a liquid, a fat or both, and usually with a leavening agent. Cakes are usually baked, but can be griddled. In their oldest forms, cakes were modifications of bread, but cakes now cover a wide range of preparations that can be simple or elaborate and which share features with other desserts such as pastries, meringues, custards, and pies."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Pound_layer_cake.jpg/330px-Pound_layer_cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cake"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/39/Piece_of_Cake_%28novel%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/39/Piece_of_Cake_%28novel%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APiece_of_Cake_(novel).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/82/Piece_of_Cake_%28manga%29_1.png/250px-Piece_of_Cake_%28manga%29_1.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/82/Piece_of_Cake_%28manga%29_1.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/82/Piece_of_Cake_%28manga%29_1.png/250px-Piece_of_Cake_%28manga%29_1.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APiece_of_Cake_(manga)_1.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Pound_layer_cake.jpg/500px-Pound_layer_cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Pound_layer_cake.jpg/500px-Pound_layer_cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A layer cake made of pound cake, jam, and frosting.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APound_layer_cake.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Bartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_